{
  "title": "Vibrant Garlicky Ethiopian Chicken Doro Wot",
  "description": "A garlicky and juicy Ethiopian dish featuring colby jack cheese, served in a scallop shell, perfect for a sick day, this gluten-free-friendly recipe is a twist on the traditional doro wot.",
  "cuisine": "Ethiopian",
  "diet": [
